{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936220/extras/45a028fdf43e9060beb2087a7478973a.avif?t=1768311032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936220/extras_big/45a028fdf43e9060beb2087a7478973a.webp?t=1768311032 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Power, Intrigue, and Betrayal \u2014 Will you defend truth and the imperial crown, or ascend to the pinnacle of glory?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple romanceable characters</strong> \u2014 a lieutenant, a priest, a gladiator, a governor, a slave\u2026 even a serial killer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True freedom of choice</strong> \u2014 Build your harem; adults don\u2019t settle for just one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fleeting affairs</strong> \u2014 No one can refuse you; power is the finest aphrodisiac.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursue justice or bend the law</strong> \u2014 Your word is the only truth that matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 Decide their fate: will they be your partner\u2026 or your prisoner?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme power</strong> \u2014 Do as you please, without restraint.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Also featuring:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exceptionally adorable kitty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Heroine :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im